{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"b44c66d1-9afa-4054-af41-99c7b119f9bd","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The Intervals.icu OAuth integration has been fixed, and the root causes and analysis of the colleague's notes have been documented in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-N1vkXi/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Fixes\n\n1. **Auth Init Endpoint ([`server.py`](file:///tmp/h-N1vkXi/server.py#L150-L167), [`static/app.js`](file:///tmp/h-N1vkXi/static/app.js#L25-L42)):**\n   - Switched `/api/intervals/auth/init` from an unauthenticated browser `GET` link navigation to an authenticated `POST` request using `api()`. The endpoint now returns `{\"authorize_url\": ...}`, and the client navigates via `window.location.assign(...)`, preserving the auth header stored in `localStorage`.\n2. **Duplicate Scope Error ([`config.py`](file:///tmp/h-N1vkXi/config.py#L11)):**\n   - Cleaned `SCOPES` from `\"ACTIVITY:READ,ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\"` to `\"ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\"`. Since `:WRITE` implies `:READ`, naming both caused Intervals.icu to return an `invalid_request` error.\n3. **1-Hour Artificial Expiry \u0026 Background Token Refresher ([`server.py`](file:///tmp/h-N1vkXi/server.py#L58-L82)):**\n   - Intervals.icu tokens do not expire or return `refresh_token`. Removed `DEFAULT_TOKEN_TTL = 3600`, scheduled expiry, and the background `refresh_tokens()` thread that forced status to `\"expired, reconnect\"`.\n   - Implemented lazy revocation handling in `intervals_get`: if Intervals.icu responds with a `401 Unauthorized`, the connection status is set to `\"expired, reconnect\"` and `access_token` is cleared.\n4. **Token Exchange Payload ([`server.py`](file:///tmp/h-N1vkXi/server.py#L56-L62)):**\n   - Updated `exchange_code()` to post only `client_id`, `client_secret`, and `code`, removing `grant_type` and `redirect_uri`.\n","duration_seconds":176.119695,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":182528,"output_tokens":8389,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":721594,"total_tokens":190917}}}
